Step 4: Understanding Deployment Slots

The training introduced Deployment Slots.

Deployment Slots allow administrators to deploy and test new versions before releasing them to production.

Example:
Production Slot
       ↓
Users

Staging Slot
       ↓
Testing
Benefits:
Safer deployments
Reduced downtime
Easy rollback
Production validation

Deployment Slots are a highly tested AZ-104 topic.

Step 5: Creating and Managing Deployment Slots

The module demonstrated creating deployment slots.

Common slots:
Slot	Purpose
Production	Live application
Staging	Testing
Development	Validation
Deployment Process:
Deploy New Version
        ↓
Staging Slot
        ↓
Testing
        ↓
Swap
        ↓
Production
Key lessons learned:
Slots use the same App Service Plan resources
Applications can be validated before production release
Swapping minimizes downtime
Step 6: Understanding Slot Swaps

A major focus of the module was Slot Swapping.

After testing is complete:

Staging
     ↓ Swap ↓
Production

The new version becomes live immediately.

Benefits:
Near-zero downtime deployments
Quick rollback capability
Reduced deployment risk
Key concepts learned:
Slot swaps exchange environments
Production traffic remains uninterrupted
Rollbacks can be performed quickly
