Key Takeaway

Azure App Service provides a fully managed platform for hosting web applications and APIs without managing infrastructure. By implementing deployment slots, securing applications, configuring custom domains, enabling backups, and monitoring performance with Application Insights, Azure Administrators can deliver highly available, secure, and scalable applications. Understanding Deployment Slots, Slot Swaps, Application Insights, and App Service security features is essential for success on the AZ-104 exam and in real-world Azure environments.
